Board-only suite: the compiler change it covers exists only in the ESP32-S3_raw emitter (memory spaces normal, normal_writeback, normal_noncacheable, atomic are provided; normal_writethrough and device are refused), and the goldens are ESP32-S3_raw ones, so the host integrate run skips this directory and the STM32-L476RG_raw board run skips it too (STM32-L476RG_raw.skip). Run it with make integrate TRIAL_TARGET=ESP32-S3_raw TRIAL_SUITES=memory_space_esp32s3_addition from trials/. Remove this file only if a host-side skip mechanism replaces it.
